{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntityDB","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Off the main actor; all access goes through its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ModelContext"},{"type":"text","text":". The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"persistence plugin calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"upsert"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"delete"},{"type":"text","text":" from the debounced flush and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fetchAll"},{"type":"text","text":" during hydration \/ re-hydration."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Duplicate IDs are legitimate","type":"heading","anchor":"Duplicate-IDs-are-legitimate","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Persisted"},{"type":"text","text":" emits no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Attribute(.unique)"},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"id"},{"type":"text","text":" — CloudKit forbids"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unique constraints — so a fetch by ID may return "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"several"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" rows. Two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"devices that both create the same entity offline, or a mirrored store that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replays a record twice, produce exactly that."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every method here is therefore written to be "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"convergent"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":": writes update"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"every"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" row sharing an ID, deletions remove "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"every"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" row sharing an ID,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EntityDB\/fetchAll(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" collapses duplicates to one domain value. Nothing here"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deletes a duplicate as a side effect of a write."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That last point is deliberate. “Update one row, delete the rest”"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"looks like self-healing but loses data under CloudKit: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"persistentModelID"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is local, so two devices pick "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"different","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" survivors, each tombstones the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other’s, and after sync "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"both rows are gone","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Collapsing duplicates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"requires app knowledge of which value wins — see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EntityDB\/collapseDuplicates(as:using:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPersistence"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EntityDB"}],"externalID":"s:17SwiduxPersistence8EntityDBC","title":"EntityDB","roleHeading":"Class","symbolKind":"class","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Entit